    "text": "A compound <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> with molar weight of 80g is dissolved in a solvent having density of <math><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> . Assuming no change in volume upon dissolution, the molality of a 3.2 molar solution is",
    "image": null
